OL,3,AThey were raised on Drag Race UK - but
OL,4,Acan they snatch the crown?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new batch of queens from across the
OL,7,FUK are set to battle it out in the hope
OL,8,Fof hearing RuPaul's magical words:
OL,9,F"Condragulations, you're a winner,
OL,10,Fbaby".
OL,12,FThe UK edition of Drag Race has been
OL,13,Fputting hopeful contestants through
OL,14,Ftheir paces for seven years - plenty of
OL,15,Ftime for a new wave of talent raised on
OL,16,Fthe hit reality show to emerge.
OL,18,FNow "Generation Ru" are ready to
OL,19,Fcompete for the crown and #25,000 cash
OL,20,Fprize.
